1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:02,279
Today, the sea is angry.

2
00:00:02,279 --> 00:00:03,259
Look at it.

3
00:00:03,259 --> 00:00:04,219
On days like this,

4
00:00:04,219 --> 00:00:05,320
I don't swim.

5
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,719
I stay by the ladder.

6
00:00:06,719 --> 00:00:07,940
Three steps down,

7
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:09,419
I hold on, the water

8
00:00:09,419 --> 00:00:10,519
comes up to here,

9
00:00:10,519 --> 00:00:11,539
I say good morning,

10
00:00:11,539 --> 00:00:12,960
and I come out.

11
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:15,000
Eighty-five years, amore.

12
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:15,900
I'm not stupid.

13
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:17,739
The sea doesn't care

14
00:00:17,739 --> 00:00:18,920
how old you are,

15
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:19,899
but it also doesn't

16
00:00:19,899 --> 00:00:21,820
care how brave you are.

17
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:23,300
You go when it's calm,

18
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,980
and you go with somebody.

19
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,420
Today? Ciao.

20
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,100
See you tomorrow

